ushed away with a broken water pump shaft.","q":false,"c":46},{"lap":1,"text":"Jenatzy (Mors) stopped at the pits, with a blown tire which he changed while the engine was running and took in some oil before he was off again.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":15},{"lap":1,"text":"Gaubert (Porthos) spun off a turn, ran into a wall, broke one of his wheels and did not complete the first lap.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":47},{"lap":1,"text":"Salzer sets the pace on lap one, 9 seconds ahead of Bablot; Szisz and Th\u00e9ry next.","q":false,"c":39},{"lap":1,"text":"At the end of the first lap, 11 cars had stopped at the pits to change tires.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi"},{"lap":1,"text":"Lancia pits; after 10 minutes' work the FIAT is pushed away with a broken water pump shaft.","q":false,"c":46},{"lap":2,"text":"Nazzaro leads, a minute ahead of Lautenschlager; Salzer drops to 35th with a bad rim.","q":false,"c":37},{"lap":2,"text":"Szisz loses a removable rim and crawls to the stands on the bare rim, out of the race.","q":false,"c":41},{"lap":2,"text":"Nazzaro leads, a minute ahead of Lautenschlager; Salzer drops to 35th with a bad rim.","q":false,"c":37},{"lap":2,"text":"Szisz loses a removable rim and crawls to the stands on the bare rim, out of the race.","q":false,"c":41},{"lap":3,"text":"Wagner takes the lead; Lautenschlager drops to third changing tyres; Nazzaro falls to fourth.","q":false,"c":38},{"lap":3,"text":"Salzer's rim jumps off and his wheel breaks; Duray breaks his clutch.","q":false,"c":39},{"lap":3,"text":"Wagner takes the lead; Lautenschlager drops to third changing tyres; Nazzaro falls to fourth.","q":false,"c":38},{"lap":3,"text":"Salzer's rim jumps off and his wheel breaks; Duray breaks his clutch.","q":false,"c":39},{"lap":4,"text":"The FIATs are gone: Wagner and Nazzaro out with broken crankshafts.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":4,"text":"Pierron breaks a spring and runs off near Criel; Laxen overturns at Eu, unhurt.","q":false,"c":36},{"lap":4,"text":"The FIATs are gone: Wagner and Nazzaro out with broken crankshafts.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":4,"text":"Pierron breaks a spring and runs off near Criel; Laxen overturns at Eu, unhurt.","q":false,"c":36},{"lap":5,"text":"When he passed a British car, a thrown stone smashed the glass of his goggles, and three glass splinters entered his left eye.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":5,"text":"Lautenschlager takes the lead; H\u00e9mery stops at the Benz depot for a doctor to remove the splinters.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":5,"text":"When he passed a British car, a thrown stone smashed the glass of his goggles, and three glass splinters entered his left eye.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":5,"text":"Lautenschlager takes the lead; H\u00e9mery stops at the Benz depot for a doctor to remove the splinters.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":6,"text":"Lautenschlager leads by four minutes from H\u00e9mery and Hanriot; Th\u00e9ry fourth.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":6,"text":"Harrison (Weigel) was too fast in the sharp turn of Eu, where he drove in the palisades and the car overturned.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":29},{"lap":6,"text":"Lautenschlager leads by four minutes from H\u00e9mery and Hanriot; Th\u00e9ry fourth.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":6,"text":"Harrison (Weigel) was too fast in the sharp turn of Eu, where he drove in the palisades and the car overturned.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":29},{"lap":7,"text":"H\u00e9mery sets a fast 39m44s lap; J\u00f6rns passes Cissac for fifth.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":7,"text":"H\u00e9mery sets a fast 39m44s lap; J\u00f6rns passes Cissac for fifth.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":8,"text":"There were hardly any tires left for the drivers and even at Mercedes the tires and reserves of Salzer's car were removed to use them for the other Mercedes drivers.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":8,"text":"Rigal climbs from tenth to seventh with a 37m28s lap.","q":false,"c":3},{"lap":8,"text":"There were hardly any tires left for the drivers and even at Mercedes the tires and reserves of Salzer's car were removed to use them for the other Mercedes drivers.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":8,"text":"Rigal climbs from tenth to seventh with a 37m28s lap.","q":false,"c":3},{"lap":9,"text":"Lautenschlager is ten minutes clear of H\u00e9mery; Th\u00e9ry, first French car, fourth.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":9,"text":"A bad crash happened on the 9th lap.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi"},{"lap":9,"text":"Lautenschlager is ten minutes clear of H\u00e9mery; Th\u00e9ry, first French car, fourth.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":9,"text":"A bad crash happened on the 9th lap.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi"},{"lap":10,"text":"Lautenschlager stops after nine laps to add fuel; there are no spare tyres left.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":10,"text":"Th\u00e9ry breaks his fixed rim on the last lap and is out; Rigal takes fourth.","q":false,"c":26},{"lap":10,"text":"Lautenschlager crossed the finish line in first place after 6h55m43.8s at an average speed of 111.112 km/h.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":10,"text":"H\u00e9mery came second with a burst rear tire, over 8 minutes behind the leader, and Hanriot remained third.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":10,"text":"Christian Lautenschlager won the race in his Mercedes finishing nearly nine minutes ahead of Victor H\u00e9mery's Benz.","q":true,"src":"Wikipedia","c":0},{"lap":10,"text":"Lautenschlager stops after nine laps to add fuel; there are no spare tyres left.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":10,"text":"Th\u00e9ry breaks his fixed rim on the last lap and is out; Rigal takes fourth.","q":false,"c":26},{"lap":10,"text":"Lautenschlager crossed the finish line in first place after 6h55m43.8s at an average speed of 111.112 km/h.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":10,"text":"H\u00e9mery came second with a burst rear tire, over 8 minutes behind the leader, and Hanriot remained third.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":10,"text":"Christian Lautenschlager won the race in his Mercedes finishing nearly nine minutes ahead of Victor H\u00e9mery's Benz.","q":true,"src":"Wikipedia","c":0}]}